%% 类图：接入层（网络、HTTP、图像识别），它们都不直接修改 World，而是经 SimulationEngine 排队
classDiagram
    direction LR
    class DwServer {
        +main(String[] args)$
    }
    class HttpApi {
        +start()
        +stop()
        -handle(HttpExchange ex)
        -stream(HttpExchange ex)
        -visionDetect(HttpExchange ex)
        -switchScenario(HttpExchange ex)
        -serveStatic(HttpExchange ex, String path)
    }
    class DeviceGateway {
        +start()
        +stop()
        -acceptLoop()
        -udpLoop()
    }
    class DeviceSession {
        -Socket socket
        +send(String json)
        +close(String reason)
        +isOpen() boolean
        -readLoop()
        -writeLoop()
    }
    class DeviceLink {
        <<interface>>
    }
    class SimulationEngine {
        +submit(Consumer~World~ cmd)
        +call(Function~World,T~ fn)
        +hub() SnapshotHub
    }
    class VisionService {
        +process(byte[] img, Params p) Report
        +mappedCells(Report r) int[]
        +last() Report
    }
    class ColorBlobDetector {
        +detect(int[] argb, int w, int h, boolean parallel) Result
    }
    class Config
    class MapLoader {
        +load(Path file)$ GridMap
        +validate(GridMap map)$ List~String~
    }
    class ScenarioLoader["Scenario"] {
        +load(Path file, GridMap map)$ Scenario
        +parse(String json, GridMap map)$ Scenario
    }

    DwServer ..> Config
    DwServer ..> MapLoader
    DwServer --> SimulationEngine
    DwServer --> HttpApi
    DwServer --> DeviceGateway
    HttpApi --> SimulationEngine
    HttpApi *-- VisionService
    VisionService *-- ColorBlobDetector
    DeviceGateway --> SimulationEngine
    DeviceGateway *-- "0..*" DeviceSession
    DeviceLink <|.. DeviceSession
    HttpApi ..> ScenarioLoader
